# label: alg:ch50-follow
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch50.tex:115
# caption: Propagate followers through nullable suffixes.

REQUIRE reachable grammar, completed nullable/FIRST facts, start S
ENSURE FOLLOW sets including the external end marker
initialize all FOLLOW sets empty; insert end marker in FOLLOW(S)
REPEAT
  FORALL nonterminal occurrences B -> alpha Abeta DO
    union FIRST(beta) into FOLLOW(A)
    IF beta is nullable THEN
      union FOLLOW(B) into FOLLOW(A)
    END IF
  END FOR
UNTIL no set changed

